@CommentsApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5154

### Get the first page of comments (newest first)
GET {{CommentsApi_HostAddress}}/api/comments
Accept: application/json

### Sort by user name, ascending, second page
GET {{CommentsApi_HostAddress}}/api/comments?sortBy=userName&sortOrder=asc&page=2
Accept: application/json

### Add a top-level comment
POST {{CommentsApi_HostAddress}}/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "john",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "homePage": "https://example.com",
  "text": "First comment"
}

### Reply to the comment with id 1
POST {{CommentsApi_HostAddress}}/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "mary",
  "email": "mary@example.com",
  "text": "A reply",
  "parentId": 1
}
